  "instructions": [
    "Boil the potatoes until tender, then mash them with most of the paprika and seasoning.",
    "Soften the onions and garlic in olive oil and stir in the remaining paprika.",
    "Simmer the tomatoes briefly, then combine them with the cooked chicken, peppers, and olives.",
    "Transfer the filling to a baking dish and spoon the paprika mash over the surface.",
    "Bake at 400°F until the mash is golden and the filling is bubbling."
